---
import '../game/style.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101613" />
    <meta name="description" content="Footba11 Heroes. A playable 11-a-side football game with tactical AI, real ball physics, careers and touch controls." />
    <link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>Footba11 Heroes — Make the game yours.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="shell">
      <aside class="rail">
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="brand" aria-label="Footba11 Heroes home"><span class="brand-mark">11<span>→</span></span><span>FOOTBA11<b>HEROES</b></span></a>
        <div class="rail-label">YOUR FOOTBALL WORLD</div>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <button class="nav-item active" data-nav="play"><span>◈</span> Play <i>01</i></button>
          <button class="nav-item" data-nav="player"><span>♙</span> Player career</button>
          <button class="nav-item" data-nav="manager"><span>▤</span> Manager career</button>
          <button class="nav-item" data-nav="club"><span>⬡</span> My club</button>
          <button class="nav-item" data-nav="settings"><span>⚙</span> Match settings</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="rail-bottom"><span class="edition">THE BEAUTIFUL GAME.<br />IN YOUR HANDS.</span><div class="profile"><span class="avatar" id="avatar">AH</span><span id="profile-name">Alex Hero<small>LOCAL PROFILE</small></span><button id="edit-profile" aria-label="Edit player profile">→</button></div></div>
      </aside>
      <main>
        <header class="topbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE CLUBHOUSE</span><h1 id="page-heading">Let’s play football.</h1></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="season">2026 <span>/</span> 27</span><button class="icon-button" id="help-button" aria-label="Controls and how to play">?</button><button class="save-button" id="save-button"><span class="status-dot"></span> <span id="save-label">Local save</span></button></div></header>
        <section id="home-intro" class="home-intro">
          <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow mint">EVERY MATCH. A NEW STORY.</span><h2>MAKE THE<br />GAME <em>YOURS.</em></h2><p>Find the space. Build the play. Own the moment.</p></div>
          <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><span class="hero-eleven">11</span><div class="hero-stamp">NO SCRIPT.<br />JUST FOOTBALL. <span>→</span></div></div>
          <div class="hero-footer"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><span>11 v 11 <i>·</i> FULL PITCH <i>·</i> YOUR RULES OF PLAY</span></div>
        </section>
        <section class="mode-grid" id="mode-grid" aria-label="Game modes">
          <button class="mode-card selected" data-mode="quick"><span class="mode-icon">→</span><span><b>Quick match</b><small>Straight to the beautiful game</small></span><span class="mode-arrow">→</span></button>
          <button class="mode-card" data-mode="player"><span class="mode-icon">♙</span><span><b>Player career</b><small>Your training. Your life. Your legacy.</small></span><span class="mode-arrow">→</span></button>
          <button class="mode-card" data-mode="manager"><span class="mode-icon">▤</span><span><b>Manager career</b><small>Build the squad. Lead the club.</small></span><span class="mode-arrow">→</span></button>
        </section>
        <section id="career-hub" class="career-hub" hidden aria-label="Career dashboard">
          <div class="career-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow mint" id="career-eyebrow">PLAYER CAREER / YOUR JOURNEY</span><h2 id="career-title">ONE LIFE.<br />ONE LEGACY.</h2><p id="career-description"></p><div class="career-hero-meta"><span id="career-day"></span><span id="career-identity"></span></div></div><div class="career-portrait" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 250"><path d="M74 77 33 100 9 160l38 17 18-31v100h90V146l18 31 38-17-24-60-41-23-36 12z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="m74 77 36 12 36-12-13 27H87z" fill="#14382d"/><path d="M91 32a22 22 0 0 1 44 0v16a22 22 0 0 1-44 0z" fill="#d0a17c"/><path d="M90 33c-4-37 51-40 47 0l-14-9-32 12z" fill="#282726"/><text x="110" y="179" text-anchor="middle" font-size="55" font-weight="900" fill="#153b2d" id="career-shirt">10</text></svg><span id="career-portrait-caption">YOUR STORY STARTS HERE</span></div></div>
          <div id="career-metrics" class="career-metrics"></div>
          <div class="career-workspace"><div><div class="career-section-heading"><h3 id="career-actions-title">OFF THE PITCH</h3><span>CHOOSE YOUR NEXT STEP</span></div><div id="career-actions" class="career-actions"></div><div class="career-note" id="career-note"></div></div><aside class="career-schedule"><span class="eyebrow">NEXT FIXTURE</span><h3>BAKU ATHLETIC<br /><span>vs</span> COAST UNITED</h3><p id="career-match-description"></p><button class="primary" id="career-play">PLAY NEXT MATCH <span>→</span></button><button class="text-button" id="career-resume" hidden>START A NEW MATCH INSTEAD</button><div class="career-section-heading"><h3>RECENT ACTIVITY</h3></div><div id="career-activity"></div></aside></div>
        </section>
        <div class="section-heading" id="match-heading-row"><h2 id="match-section-heading">MATCH CENTRE</h2><span id="match-context">EXHIBITION <span class="dim">/</span> BAKU PARK</span></div>
        <section class="match-layout">
          <div class="match-card">
            <div class="scoreboard"><div class="team team-home"><span class="crest home-crest">BA<span>★</span></span><span><b>BAKU ATHLETIC</b><small>HOME · <span id="formation-label">4-3-3</span></small></span></div><div class="score-centre"><div class="score"><span id="home-score">0</span><span class="score-dash">:</span><span id="away-score">0</span></div><div class="clock-pill"><span class="status-dot"></span><span id="clock">00:00</span><span id="half-label">PRE-MATCH</span></div></div><div class="team team-away"><span><b>COAST UNITED</b><small>AWAY · 4-3-3</small></span><span class="crest away-crest">CU<span>◆</span></span></div></div>
            <div class="pitch-wrap" id="pitch-wrap"><canvas id="pitch" aria-label="Interactive football pitch. Use WASD or the touch joystick to move. J passes, K shoots, L crosses. Press question mark for all controls." tabindex="0"></canvas><div class="pitch-label"><span class="status-dot"></span><span id="pitch-status">KICK-OFF READY</span></div><div class="pitch-weather" aria-hidden="true">☀ &nbsp; 21° &nbsp; BAKU</div><div class="match-message" id="match-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="match-overlay" id="match-overlay"><span id="overlay-eyebrow">THE STAGE IS SET</span><h3 id="overlay-title">Your pitch. Your moment.</h3><p id="overlay-description">A full 11 v 11 match. Build it your way.</p><button class="primary" id="kickoff-button">KICK OFF <span>→</span></button><span class="overlay-note" id="overlay-note">12 MIN / HALF · KEYBOARD + TOUCH</span></div></div>
            <div class="match-toolbar"><div><span class="kit-dot"></span><b id="controlled-label">BAKU ATHLETIC</b><span class="toolbar-hint" id="action-hint">Choose a mode, then kick off</span></div><div><button class="text-button" id="target-button" title="Choose the next passing target">Target <kbd>Tab</kbd></button><button class="icon-button small" id="pause-button" aria-label="Pause match" disabled>II</button><button class="text-button camera-toggle" id="camera-toggle" aria-pressed="false" title="Oyunçuları yaxından gör">Yaxın baxış</button><button class="icon-button small" id="fullscreen-button" aria-label="Toggle full screen">⛶</button></div></div>
            <div class="manager-controls" id="manager-controls" hidden><div><span class="eyebrow mint">TOUCHLINE COMMANDS</span><p>You lead the team. Your players handle the ball.</p></div><div class="manager-command-buttons"><button data-manager-tactic="balanced">BALANCED</button><button data-manager-tactic="press">PRESS</button><button data-manager-tactic="wide">WIDE</button><button data-manager-tactic="counter">COUNTER</button><button id="manager-squad">SQUAD ⇄</button></div></div>
            <section class="offball-panel" id="offball-panel" hidden aria-label="Top istəmə köməkçisi">
              <div class="offball-copy"><span class="offball-eyebrow" id="offball-eyebrow">TOPSUZ OYUN</span><strong id="offball-title" role="status" aria-live="polite">Boş yerə çıx, sonra topu istə</strong><p id="offball-description">R düyməsinə bas və ya TOP İSTƏ düyməsinə toxun.</p><div class="request-meter" id="request-meter" hidden><i id="request-meter-fill"></i></div></div>
              <button class="call-ball-button" id="call-ball-button"><span class="call-hand" aria-hidden="true">↑</span><span>TOP İSTƏ <kbd>R</kbd></span></button>
            </section>
            <div class="touch-controls" id="touch-controls"><div class="joystick" id="joystick" aria-label="Movement joystick"><div class="joystick-ring"></div><div class="joystick-stick" id="joystick-stick"></div><span>MOVE</span></div><div class="action-controls"><div class="control-row"><button class="game-button sprint" data-hold="sprint">SPRINT <kbd>⇧</kbd></button><button class="game-button" data-action="switch">SWITCH <kbd>Q</kbd></button><button class="game-button" data-action="tackle">TACKLE <kbd>F</kbd></button></div><div class="control-row"><button class="game-button" data-action="pass">PASS <kbd>J</kbd></button><button class="game-button" data-action="through">THROUGH <kbd>U</kbd></button><button class="game-button" data-action="cross">CROSS <kbd>L</kbd></button><button class="game-button shoot" data-action="shoot">SHOOT <kbd>K</kbd></button></div></div></div>
            <div class="match-bottom"><span><b>W A S D</b> Move <i>·</i> <b>J</b> Pass <i>·</i> <b>K</b> Shoot <i>·</i> <b>X</b> One-two</span><button class="text-button" id="all-controls">ALL CONTROLS →</button></div>
          </div>
          <aside class="match-panel">
            <div class="panel-tabs"><button class="active" data-panel="tactics">TACTICS</button><button data-panel="stats">STATS</button><button data-panel="events">FEED</button></div>
            <div id="panel-tactics" class="panel-content"><div id="player-match-summary" hidden></div><div id="tactical-management"><div class="panel-heading"><span>MATCH PLAN</span><span class="small-badge">HOME</span></div><label class="field-label" for="formation">FORMATION</label><select id="formation"><option>4-3-3</option><option>4-4-2</option><option>4-2-3-1</option><option>3-5-2</option></select><div class="mini-pitch" id="mini-pitch" aria-label="Team formation"></div><label class="field-label" for="tactic">TEAM APPROACH</label><select id="tactic"><option value="balanced">Balanced</option><option value="wide">Play the wings</option><option value="press">High press</option><option value="counter">Counter-attack</option></select><div class="tactic-description" id="tactic-description">Keep your shape. Move the ball. Find the opening.</div><div class="panel-divider"></div><div class="panel-heading"><span>YOUR ELEVEN</span><span id="subs-count">0 / 5 SUBS</span></div><div id="lineup" class="lineup"></div></div></div>
            <div id="panel-stats" class="panel-content" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><span>MATCH STATISTICS</span><span>BA / CU</span></div><div id="match-stats"></div><p class="panel-note">Live statistics from this match. Possession measures time on the ball.</p></div>
            <div id="panel-events" class="panel-content" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><span>TOUCHLINE FEED</span><span class="status-dot"></span></div><div id="event-feed" class="event-feed"><p class="panel-note">The story starts at kick-off.</p></div></div>
            <div class="panel-footer"><span class="status-dot"></span> SIDELINE 3D · LIVE MATCH</div>
          </aside>
        </section>
        <footer class="page-footer"><span>FOOTBA11 HEROES <span class="dim">/</span> THE BEAUTIFUL GAME, REIMAGINED.</span><button class="text-button" id="menu-button">← MAIN MENU</button></footer>
      </main>
    </div>
    <dialog id="settings-dialog"><form id="settings-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</span><button type="button" class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close settings">×</button></div><h2>Match settings</h2><p>Choose your tempo. Football should have time to breathe.</p><label for="half-minutes">REAL MINUTES PER HALF</label><select id="half-minutes"><option value="5">5 minutes</option><option value="8">8 minutes</option><option value="12" selected>12 minutes · default</option><option value="15">15 minutes</option><option value="20">20 minutes</option><option value="45">45 minutes · real time</option></select><label for="player-name">PLAYER NAME</label><input id="player-name" maxlength="24" value="Alex Hero" required /><div class="form-columns"><div><label for="player-role">CAREER POSITION</label><select id="player-role"><option value="DEF">Defender</option><option value="MID" selected>Midfielder</option><option value="FWD">Forward</option></select></div><div><label for="shirt-number">SHIRT NUMBER</label><input id="shirt-number" type="number" min="2" max="99" value="10" required /></div></div><label for="kit-color">HOME KIT</label><select id="kit-color"><option value="mint">Athletic mint</option><option value="blue">Royal blue</option><option value="rose">Rose red</option></select><p class="panel-note" id="settings-note">Match length applies to your next match. Your profile is stored on this device.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">SAVE SETTINGS <span>✓</span></button></form></dialog>
    <dialog id="help-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE PLAYBOOK</span><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close controls">×</button></div><h2>Play the whole pitch.</h2><p>Move with WASD or the joystick. Click a teammate or tap Target to choose a receiver. Hold an action button to add power.</p><div class="help-grid"><span><kbd>WASD / ↑↓←→</kbd> Move / aim</span><span><kbd>Shift</kbd> Sprint</span><span><kbd>J / Space</kbd> Short pass</span><span><kbd>R</kbd> Top istə / call for a pass</span><span><kbd>U</kbd> Through ball</span><span><kbd>L</kbd> Long pass / cross</span><span><kbd>K</kbd> Shoot / header</span><span><kbd>X</kbd> One-two</span><span><kbd>Z</kbd> Close control</span><span><kbd>F</kbd> Tackle</span><span><kbd>C</kbd> Clear the ball</span><span><kbd>Q</kbd> Switch player</span><span><kbd>P / Esc</kbd> Pause</span></div><p>Restarts: aim with movement, select a receiver, then pass, cross or shoot. Topsuz oyun: boş yerə çıx, R bas və ya TOP İSTƏ düyməsinə toxun. Yaşıl bildiriş ötürmənin yolda olduğunu, narıncı bildiriş isə yolun bağlı və ya ofsayd olduğunu göstərir. Player career: live your own football journey, train, rest and control only your player. Manager career: manage the club, squad, training and tactics while your team plays autonomously.</p><p class="panel-note">This browser edition implements a tested core rules subset, not a certified implementation of all 17 IFAB laws. Competition-specific extra time, shootouts, injuries and advanced referee procedures are outside the current release.</p><button class="primary close-dialog">BACK TO THE PITCH <span>→</span></button></dialog>
    <dialog id="club-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR STORY SO FAR</span><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close club">×</button></div><h2>Baku Athletic</h2><p>A new club. A blank page. A legacy to build.</p><div class="club-record" id="club-record"></div><div id="career-history"></div><p class="panel-note">Career results and your profile are saved on this browser. An unfinished match is recorded as a saved match, not a completed result.</p><button class="primary close-dialog">BACK TO THE CLUB <span>→</span></button></dialog>
    <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <script>import '../game/app.mjs';</script>
  </body>
</html>
